<section class="commissions section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Pet Portrait Commissions</h2>
    <div class="content">
      <p>
        I enjoy creating realistic artwork full of detail and personality. My goal is to portray exactly how goofy or straight-faced, sassy or devoted, angelic or full of mischief your pet is.
      </p>
      <p>
        When you commission a portrait from me, you're getting my commitment to drawing every hair, feather or scale in order to bring your beloved pet to life on paper.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

